# File manager

- All uploads go through `create_managed_file` (`data: CreateManagedFileData` or `file_obj=`).
- Domain models **FK / O2O to `ManagedFile`** — never add ad-hoc `FileField` / `ImageField` for product files.
- Categories only in `enums.FileCategory` (`avatar`, `image`, `document`, `other`); rules in `constants.CATEGORY_FILE_RULES`.
- User-owned only (`owner`); no clinic/org ownership in this scaffold.
{%- if cookiecutter.use_scoped_apis == "y" %}
- Mount: `/api/v1/<scope>/files/` on every scope (never bare `/api/v1/files/`). Gate list/detail with `IsScopeMember`. Download URLs via `managed_file_download_path` (uses `request.api_scope`).
{%- else %}
- Mount: `/api/v1/files/`.
{%- endif %}
- Delete via `delete_managed_file`; disk cleanup is the `post_delete` signal.
- Download: `serve_managed_file_securely` (FileResponse in DEBUG).
- Changing upload contracts / mounts → update **this rule file**{% if cookiecutter.use_scoped_apis == "y" %} (+ `scoped-apis` when scope URL layout changes){% endif %} in the **same** change.

